{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":18087,\"date\":\"2026-09-26T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-26T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-golden-gate-cosa-sparisce-e-cosa-cambia-con-macos-28\",\"title\":\"macOS Golden Gate: cosa sparisce oggi e cosa cambia con macOS 28\",\"excerpt\":\"Con macOS Golden Gate Apple taglia supporto per Intel, Boot Camp, Rosetta 2 (in modo definitivo) e servizi legacy come AFP, Time Capsule e AirPort Utility. Ulteriori riduzioni sono attese con macOS 28.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17958,\"date\":\"2026-09-22T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-22T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-beta-macos-golden-gate-27-2-sviluppatori\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la seconda beta di macOS Golden Gate 27.2 agli sviluppatori\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta testando macOS Golden Gate 27.2 e ha reso disponibile agli sviluppatori la seconda beta, a una settimana dalla prima. Novità attesa: Siri AI in nuove lingue.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17872,\"date\":\"2026-09-18T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-18T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-golden-gate-50-novita-siri-app-interfaccia\",\"title\":\"macOS Golden Gate: 50 novità tra Siri, app Apple e interfaccia\",\"excerpt\":\"macOS 27 Golde